#: ../../config/options_ratings.rst:4
msgid ":index:`Ratings <configuration; ratings>`"
msgstr ":index:`评分 <configuration; ratings>`"

#: ../../config/options_ratings.rst:17
msgid "**Enable track ratings**"
msgstr "**启用音轨评分**"

#: ../../config/options_ratings.rst:19
msgid "Check to write track ratings to your files."
msgstr "勾选此项将音轨评分写入您的文件。"

#: ../../config/options_ratings.rst:21
msgid "**E-mail**"
msgstr "**电子邮件**"

#: ../../config/options_ratings.rst:23
msgid "The email address used when submitting ratings to MusicBrainz. This identifies the user that provided the rating."
msgstr "提交评分到 MusicBrainz 时使用的电子邮件地址。这标识了提供评分的用户。"

#: ../../config/options_ratings.rst:25
msgid "**Submit ratings to MusicBrainz**"
msgstr "**向 MusicBrainz 提交评分**"

#: ../../config/options_ratings.rst:27
msgid "Check to submit ratings to MusicBrainz. The tracks will be rated with your account."
msgstr "勾选此项将评分提交到 MusicBrainz。音轨将使用您的账户进行评分。"
